ll my otaku just like Deku  and he eventually became all my sidekick  after persistently pestering all my to  accept him at the time all might was not  interested in taking on a sidekick but  night I was so stubborn that all might  eventually relented with that said sir  Knight I believes that the ability to  smile in the face of hardship and the  ability to make other people laugh and  smile is absolutely crucial for a  successful hero and especially for the  one hero who is considered to be the  very  full of peace this is why night I  admired all might so greatly almighty  was always able to keep smiling no  matter how hard of a challenge he was  facing and this is exactly what put the  general populace at ease the people knew  that no matter what happens everything  would be okay because all might would be  there with a smile on his face ready to  save them from villains accidents  natural disasters and just about  anything that life could throw at them  like many other people sir Knight I was  worried that after all meit's retirement  no one would be able to step in and fill  all my shoes certainly someone like  endeavor despite being a really strong  hero does not possess the type of  uplifting and friendly personality that  can put everyone around him at ease this  is why night I wanted me do toget uh to  become all my successor and the  inheritor of one for all media also has  that same ability to overcome even the  hardest challenges while maintaining a  positive outlook and a smile on his face  just like all might me do is powerful  enough to instill fear into villains and  cheery and positive enough to instill  hope into civilians because of his  belief that media should have been all  my successor sir Knight I is initially  skeptical about Deku and he is slow to  warm up to him at this point it is worth  mentioning why exactly sir Knight I  stopped being on my sidekick for those  of you who might be wondering after all  my defeated all-4-one the previous time  about six years earlier Almighty was  severely injured but despite being  injured all might insisted that he  should still keep being a hero as usual  however sir Knight I disagreed Knight I  believe that all might should retire and  pick a successor because all my injuries  were so severe that they could result in  all my dying in battle but all might  refuse to retire believing that if he  retired now before preparing a true  successor the general populace would  become uneasy and an era of fear and  uncertainty would ensue because he  didn't want to have any part in his  friends reckless behavior sir Knight I  decided to stop being all my sidekick  and he opened his own hero office  instead now let's talk about sir Knight  ice quirk because part of the reason why  night I was so sure that all my children  tyre is directly related to the nature  of his quirk the quirk  foresight gives its user the ability to  see into the future of a specific person  if he touches a person and makes eye  contact with them Sir Knight I can see  what is going to happen to that person  for one hour in great detail needless to  say this is an incredibly powerful quirk  as it allows night eye to predict the  moves of his opponents or to find out  information about his targets that they  never would have disclosed otherwise  such as for example the location of  their secret hideout sir Knight I can  only use this ability once every 24  hours so that is a major limitation and  the way that sir Knight I see someone's  future is very specific he sees all the  events from a third-person perspective  as if looking through a roll of film  this means that he doesn't hear any  sounds or smell any smells his foresight  works solely on the basis of his visual  senses another important aspect of  foresight is that beyond being able to  tell very precisely what a person will  do within the next hour night I squirt  also allows him to gain less specific  glimpses into a person's more distant 